The files in this folder are a fixed-point port of the DSP code of Mutable
Instruments Beads (https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack/tree/master/beads),
and of the parts of stmlib it uses. The original code is released under the
MIT licence below, which also covers this port. The rest of the firmware is
GPL-3.0 (see LICENSE at the top of the repository).

